- *     heap so the title can use them for normal contiguous allocations.
+ *     visible address space) -- the title can't relocate the window.
+ *  2. Growth removes the newly claimed span from the page supply,
+ *     relocating movable owners first.  Shrink returns only pages
+ *     acquired by a successful claim.  Failed growth returns NULL and
+ *     preserves the previous claim rather than exposing another owner
